<title>USA: Sygnet Wireless Inc Q1 net loss with acquisition.</title>
<headline>Sygnet Wireless Inc Q1 net loss with acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>CANFIELD, Ohio 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended March 31</p>
<p>							   1997	 1996</p>
<p>Revenue</p>
<p>     Subscriber revenue		    $11,725,100 $6,098,160</p>
<p>     Roamer revenue			    5,145,503  1,245,128</p>
<p>     Equipment sales			     944,677    304,818</p>
<p>     Other revenue				 438,462    377,631</p>
<p> Total revenue				  18,253,742  8,025,737</p>
<p> Total costs and  expenses		  17,098,488  6,262,779</p>
<p> Income from operations			1,155,254  1,762,958</p>
<p>     Interest expense, net		   7,402,412  1,303,622</p>
<p>     Other expense				     100	1,650</p>
<p> Net (loss) income			   (6,247,258)    457,686</p>
<p> Net loss applicable to common shrholders(7,046,047)    --</p>
<p>Net loss per share applicable to common</p>
<p>   shareholders				     (1.15)	   --</p>
<p> Common share outstanding		    6,170,630	   --</p>
<p>NOTE: The growth in revs,operating cash flow was primarily a result of the acquisition of cellular properties from Horizon Cellular group in late 1996, the company said. Related expenses and charges caused an overall net loss.</p>
